{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“I have… no in-ten-tion… of tel-ling sec-rets.”","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:04:15.270000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868221998680141914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure nods. \"Do you, or have you ever, worked for the British crown? If so, when and what duties did you have?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:13:42.082000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868224376061960243","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
