{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure looks to Apgan and stifles a small laugh. They use prestidigitation to clean it, before taking the letters and nodding. \"I hear the roses have receded now?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:39:49.442000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868230950046273588","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"These taxes are intolerable, even if they are temporary.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:40:21.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868231085899808838","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I made my way to the Murry Hill Park with my friend Fuddles who you just met, I would not have been safe without her. So glad those thorns are gone\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:42:05.941000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T20:42:12.624000Z","id":"868231522564603926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod. \"Now then, down to business. I represent a part of the rebellion, a part that is interested in recruiting both of you.\" They conjure a pair of mugs with a fizzing liquid inside from seemingly nowhere. \"To that end, I invite you to drink.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:43:00.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868231752865443861","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Apgan looks at the mug skeptically, but drinks it down in one gulp.","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:43:36.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868231903134760961","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I'm still a bit hungover so I hope nothing comes back up\" Ed drinks from their mug as well","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:44:04.523000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T20:44:24.562000Z","id":"868232019933548615","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"It tastes pleasant and fuzzy. You are unable to lie to this figure for the next hour.","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:44:11.373000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868232048664535080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Excellent. To begin with, do either of you have any other aliases or identities besides the one you are now?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:45:13.102000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868232307574714368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"None other than my pirate name of Ed the Third Wheel and Bun which was what momma called me\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:46:11.879000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868232554103337031","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Bessie. I knew a man by the name of Tortillini, and told him that if he should attract the attention of the rebels with his exploits, I should be referred to as Bessie.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:46:36.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868232656998002790","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"To my knowledge, nothing has come from this, unless it was his recommendation that brought me here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:47:00.307000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868232757225086986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Otherwise Apgan is my name, and has always been.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:47:50.840000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868232969175855105","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure nods to themself. \"Do you have any intention to divulge any secrets learned about this organization to anyone not a part of the organization?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:48:15.963000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868233074549346334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I have no reasons to\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:49:33.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868233400648081438","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"None. I fear that my Lamplighter duties and my loyalty to my Sergeant might cause some conflict, but I also suspect that my Sergeant has already been made a member. A man by the name of Nolan Reeve.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:49:37.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868233415609172058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They smile and nod. \"I think you will find no conflict between our two interests. Do you currently or have you ever worked for the British crown. If so, when and what were your duties?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:51:14.986000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868233825426227202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Never. I have done odd jobs around the city for many figures, Loyalist and Patriot alike, but never for the crown.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:52:37.441000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868234171267579966","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Never, before I was part of a pirate crew, very much free of every other employer but ourselves\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:53:11.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868234314394005564","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"What are your opinions of the occupation of Arcania by the British crown and the crown in general?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:53:52.603000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868234486519844904","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Apgan almost laughs. \"Poor. Arcania needs no godwar.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:54:56.280000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868234753600540672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"It is choking the life out of the citizens here, with their taxes, with their soldiers, with their imminent threat, even without being physically here\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:55:48.115000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868234971012292700","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod. \"Are you willing to go to great and dangerous lengths to end the occupation by the British and ensure the freedom and well-being of Arcania and her peoples?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:57:36.216000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868235424420724786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Aye.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:57:48.930000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868235477747134514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"At the risk of my own life, yes\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T20:58:17.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868235597540634705","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
