{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"She raised an eyebrow. \"Oh? And this.. opportunity is...\" She said, keeping the interest out of her voice as best she could.","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:04:26.775000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868252245924384819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Helping the revolution.\" The figure says simply. \"If that is of interest to you, I invite you to drink.\" They produce a mug of foaming liquid from seemingly nowhere and slide it over to you.","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:12:42.166000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868254323744866394","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"She eyed the mug, then looked back at the figure. \"How do I know this isn't a trick?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:13:53.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868254623499161640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
