{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I don't.\" She then relaxed a little, a question running across her face. She then looked at the drink... her eyes narrowing.","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:31:00.644000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868258931095535689","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"well, lets just get started then. To your knowledge, have you associated with any redcoats or other officers of the British crown? If so, when and under what situation?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:33:06.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868259459061936208","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"She begins spitting out insults in Infernal before catching herself. Unclasping her mouth, she lowered her voice. \"Why would I associate with them? I was the pilot in a raid a while back. Stole a flagship of theirs before taking pleasure in watching it burn to the ground.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:36:31.552000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868260319024259133","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I apologize, but you haven't been someone we've kept tabs on. We don't know your experiences, so we have to make sure. Did you tell anyone you were coming here or do you believe you were followed?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:39:14.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868261003454980116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Only one who knows I'd be here is Ipra. As for followed, I doubt it. I don't know if the Reds are keeping tabs on me, but I highly doubt it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:41:04.778000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868261465017159730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod. \"Do you have any aliases or other identities besides this one?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:42:47.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868261897068236851","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"She shook her head. \"I've never done anything to warrant it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:43:41.994000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868262124428861470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Do you plan to divulge any secrets learned from us to anyone outside of the organization?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:44:43.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868262383934664724","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"At this she took a moment. Something felt... wrong in keeping secrets from Johnathan, but... \"I... have a beloved. I would want to tell him...\" She clamped down on her lip. \"But if I must, I'll take the secrets to the grave. Not even he will know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T22:49:04.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868263478115319848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
